      "@type": "cat-harness:Tool",
      "description": "Write a JSON-LD node and a thin page for each model an instance's `cat-archimate.config.json` names and for every view, element and relationship in it — keyed by Archi's own ids — plus the normalised model the pages' one loader draws from, and every view drawn as SVG from the model's own bounds and bendpoints in ArchiMate's notation, each box a link to its element. `--out` writes into a site being built — the data at the graph's path, the pages at the route of the visualiser the instance declares for this Tool, `<locale>/<harness>/<id>/`; without it the files go into the graph and `--check` gates them.",
      "install": {
        "none": true
      },
